<h2 class="lsu-scope-home">Endurance, stripped back.</h2>
<p class="lsu-scope-home">No set finish distance. No way to know how long you will be out there. Last Soul Ultra tests how long you can keep returning to the start.</p>
</div>
<div class="lsu-scope-home y87-chapter">
<h2 class="lsu-scope-home">Live, loop after loop.</h2>
<p class="lsu-scope-home">Follow the race through our livestream. Watch the field get smaller, the nights get longer and the next start become the only thing that matters.</p>
</div>
